{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"27323","model":{"presentationWorkId":"egs:27323","staff":{"artwork":[],"scenario":[],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_bangumi_42165","characterName":"Aya","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"42165","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"292888"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Aya","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"古来から暗殺業を生業としていた「忌血」の一族を継ぐ美しき女剣士。天性のずば抜けた剣術の才能を持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼き頃より剣術の達人である父親「朧」と二人で暮らし、日々厳しく鍛えられてきた彩は若くして父親と同等の力を得るまでに成長した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなある日、別れて暮らす継母「椿」が何者かに虐殺されたと知った父「朧」は姿を消し、行方知れずとなった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"１人残された彩は、屍霊討伐の情報屋だという「レイ」と名乗る女からの接触を受け、屍霊ハンターとして活動を開始する。屍霊を倒し続けていれば、いつかは父「朧」に、さらには腹違いの妹「咲」に辿りつけるのではと考えたためである・・・。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"42165"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/45/4582922589d62d39140081e7b81e9341e1731fe594b85321479b81037cce1ad7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0e/0e53113087eefa0da40b1c775f52a99c74f86c8e4a1eed36f452e3c1645f83a3.webp","width":119,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"日笠陽子","creatorId":"vndb:s616","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s616","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s616","name":"日笠 陽子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:292888:42165:5119:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_72305","characterName":"Saki","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"72305","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"292888"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Saki","characterNameSource":null,"role":"主角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"彩の異母妹。幼き頃、父「朧」が彩をつれて家を出たため、母一人子一人で育った咲にとって、優しい母親の「椿」だけが唯一の心の支えであった。しかし、ある日、母は何者かに命を奪われ、咲は心のよりどころを失ってしまう・・・。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"最愛の母を殺したのは自分と母を捨てた父親、そして腹違いの姉「彩」であると知った咲は、復讐を決意し剣の腕を磨く。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さらに咲は、太古の秘法を使えば、母を蘇らせる術があることをも知る。そのためには母と血のつながった忌血族の生きた心臓が必用であった。咲は屍霊を呼び起こし使役する能力を用いて、彩をおびきだそうと画策する・・・憎き彩の心臓を奪い母を蘇らせるために。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"72305"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5e/5ebddf0c07a8fa3749c9b61a0cead2b35aa812e04fa9e5e5e36ca8cd7f83d38c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8e/8ea7fe48e0412293fc16135a5dd35ef4f48cda075350cdf9122baee73e459684.webp","width":110,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"五十嵐裕美","creatorId":"vndb:s77","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s77","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s77","name":"五十嵐 裕美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:292888:72305:5208:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_bangumi_72306","characterName":"Lei","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"72306","match":"source-roster","subjectId":"292888"}]},"originalCharacterName":"Lei","characterNameSource":null,"role":"配角","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"bangumi","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"屍霊ハンターの同業者であり、情報屋として彩にコンタクトしてきた女性。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彩に屍霊発生の情報を与えて討伐させる代わりに、彩の家族の情報を提供する間柄で、いわゆるビジネスパートナーである。彩に対して通信でいろいろと指示をする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"素性についてはほとんど不明で謎の多い人物。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、レイにも姉妹はいるらしい。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"72306"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/043f03f806f6bd2672cf9453fdda5a48cf90783057fb0310a0283949e71f5ea0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/ce2f71c1fbde165855884ead1e15b3326bb2d366510237ca7cd571f732159194.webp","width":125,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小林ゆう","creatorId":"vndb:s246","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s246","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s246","name":"小林 ゆう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:292888:72306:4398:1","source":"bangumi"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p592","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:731","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p592","name":"D3 PUBLISHER INC.","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:27323:731","source":"egs"}],"missingStates":["confirmed-character-relation-missing","current-runtime-cover-unavailable","vndb-work-mapping-pending"],"source":"terminal-wiki-full-runtime-v7"}}
